  "counterfeit_notes": "No documented counterfeits. Bulk '50pcs LT1115CN8' lots of a ~20 USD part suggest remarks or pulls. Buy authorised; check logo, top mark, date code and noise. Any 'LT1115 SO-8' is fake; new LT1115CSW stock is old or recovered.",
